### Health and integration status
GET http://localhost:8000/api/health

### Demo pricing
GET http://localhost:8000/api/pricing

### Classroom-only calculation example; these are not provider prices
POST http://localhost:8000/api/cost/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_provider": "AWS",
  "target_provider": "GCP",
  "current_hourly_cost": 0.10,
  "target_hourly_cost": 0.07,
  "duration_hours": 720,
  "transfer_cost": 12,
  "migration_overhead": 5,
  "other_costs": 3,
  "minimum_savings_percent": 1
}

### Provider recommendation
POST http://localhost:8000/api/decisions/recommend
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_provider": "AWS",
  "duration_hours": 720,
  "current_hourly_cost": 0.10,
  "required_vcpu": 2,
  "required_memory_gb": 8,
  "transfer_cost": 1,
  "migration_overhead": 1,
  "minimum_savings_percent": 1,
  "region": "us-east-1"
}

### Create simulation
POST http://localhost:8000/api/migrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source_provider": "AWS",
  "target_provider": "GCP",
  "simulation": true,
  "workload_name": "web-api-demo"
}
